WEBVTT

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:05.960
It was an era when a man lived as a warrior...

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.770
He fought, staking his life on
his faith in the sword...

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:13.010
The final era... the Bakumatsu.

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:14.810
(The end of the samurai period)
The final era... the Bakumatsu.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:24.750
<i>IROHANIHOETO</i>

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.950
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu
<i>IROHANIHOETO</i>

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:46.840
On the land with the frozen moonlight

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:50.680
It's rolling and drawing the line

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:57.890
The era of destruction and rebirth now begins

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:01.560
Heavily holding the freedom

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:05.160
Choosing the invisible path

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:12.230
Passing the sunset that's brighter than the daylight

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:19.240
The vessel of time moves on as if telling the dream

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:28.340
There's a new dawn beyond the dark path

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:36.260
We may have been born from the arm of darkness

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:39.800
Just like being in an impossible love

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:43.770
We wander into the light

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:49.040
The path stretches indefinitely

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:54.480
And there's no way to go back

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:02.920
Sunbu Castle

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:05.590
So, where did the Head go?
Sunbu Castle

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:05.650
Sunbu Castle

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:06.950
We don't know yet.
Sunbu Castle

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:09.990
Then we will not move from this place.

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:12.830
Imperial Prince Taruhito Arisugawanomiya

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:14.930
But His Majesty is tired of waiting.

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:18.730
Kichinosuke Takamori Saigo

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:18.400
I know.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:23.930
But the flag of the Nishiki Army
isn't enough to move history forward.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:29.140
It's too late for the plum but too early
for the cherry blossoms, is it?

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:36.630
Kaishu Katsu Awanokami

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:32.510
Oh well, I guess the flower buds
are still the symbol of the spring.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.080
How distasteful...

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:47.930
Damn... Where is that Head hiding anyway?

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.640
Note: The year 1868

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.640
It is early spring in the 4th year of the Keio Era.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:59.140
Two men ride the Tokai Road, heading for Sunbu.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:59.200
Kyunosuke Masumitsu

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:59.200
Tesshu Yamaoka

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.840
Are you from the Eastern Army?

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.240
You're in the way! Move!

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.950
Move out of the way!

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:13.850
You must be Tesshu Yamaoka and
Kyunosuke Masamitsu.

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:17.860
Hand over the secret letter
from Awanokami-sama.

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:18.920
What?

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.000
You ruffian!

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:33.700
Wait, Kyunosuke! Do not attack him carelessly!

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.510
Kyunosuke!

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:44.880
Damn!

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:46.490
Let me handle it.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:51.990
What is your name?

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:53.460
Which style do you practice?

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:57.160
I'm someone who thinks
a sword has no need of a name.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.490
In that case, your grave
has no need of a name, either!

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:31.720
<i>THE</i>
<i>REQUEST</i>

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:26.530
The secret letter was from the 15th Shogun,
Yoshinobu, to the Imperial Palace.

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:29.970
It expressed his desire to enter into
an alliance with the Emperor.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:36.940
Had this letter not reached the government army,
Edo would surely have become a battlefield.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:01.890
This great earthquake brought
an unexpected stalemate in the era.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.600
The main Eastern Army was stuck in Sunbu.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:09.870
Edo

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:09.870
Hakone

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:09.870
Sunbu

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:04.670
The main Eastern Army was stuck in Sunbu.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:10.100
Other divisions advancing up the Nakasen and
Hokuriku Roads were also forced to halt.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.810
I love the sea!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:35.590
There's a world out there beyond the sea!

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:40.120
It's gotten to my brain...

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:41.330
This is not good...

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:54.980
Ryoma...

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:35.650
The Yokohama Foreign Merchant Area, 1853.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:38.320
It was the window the Shogunate
had opened up to the world

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:43.690
after submitting to foreign pressure when
the Black Ships appeared on the Uraga Sea.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:50.960
The city was isolated and
surrounded by the Horikiri River.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:52.840
The city was split by Nihon Road.

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:59.240
The Japanese lived on the west side of it
and the east area was reserved for foreigners.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:04.350
Merchants and people of
various social classes gathered there,

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:08.550
and in the midst of the chaos of both
anticipation and anxiety for the new era,

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:11.490
the city was rife with disorderly liveliness.

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:23.440
You barbarians aren't welcome in Japan!

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:24.910
I'll make you rust on my sword!

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.670
It was you who made the first move!

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.740
Don't fall back!

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:30.980
Kill them! Kill them both!

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:34.040
If you stand against us, I'll shoot you down!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.670
Kill them! Kill them!

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.920
Come at me and I'll kill you
without a second thought!

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.750
Right. So you'd better not move!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.060
Curse you, you monkeys!

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.060
Hey!

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:22.860
Nobody move!

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.420
This is the Office of the Kanagawa Magistrate!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:38.000
I found a man in trouble!

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.610
First time in Yokohama?

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:46.920
You...

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:49.820
Up to something, aren't you?

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:53.490
Right here.

00:08:56.660 --> 00:08:57.760
Come in.

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:02.460
Ebisu, show him around in there.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:05.700
Go in.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:31.390
Excuse me from the stage, and
please allow us to introduce ourselves!

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:35.540
From the western sea to the eastern shore!

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:38.210
The salty wind blows harshly
on the traveling seagulls.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:42.070
A dagger hidden in the chest
has decayed the love on the stage.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:48.970
What blooms in red is the lycoris flower,
but what's even redder is this play of fate.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:53.650
I'm Kakunojo Yuyama, the head of the troupe!

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:57.230
Now then, let me introduce myself next!

00:09:57.230 --> 00:10:01.430
A man of such handsomeness that I cause the
fullest moon to hide behind the clouds in shame!

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:05.770
A bandit in woman's clothes
or a goddess of arts and wisdom?

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.440
Some may call me homeless or groundless.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:10.890
All are correct, for I am Shiranui-kozo!

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:13.700
Next is I, the one who hides his face.

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:18.380
People think I'm a demon or thief
even when I'm suffering.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:21.850
I laugh at night and cry in the day,
but never reveal my heart.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.610
Ebisu no Zukin! Here I am!

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.720
Next up is the man with the torn umbrella.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.820
Don't you look at me the wrong way
or you're going to get hurt.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:34.060
For ten years have I been unable
to find myself a job

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:36.800
and now I'm most proud of this umbrella.

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:39.930
I now run this business as Zagashira,
the head of this troupe.

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:43.970
And finally allow me to introduce myself.

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:46.440
I terrify even Nue birds and crows
and they stop dead in the sky.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:48.740
I'm the strongman of Adachigahara.

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:51.940
I stared down the Heavens and grab the Earth.

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:54.710
Kakashi no Keishin!

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:58.690
And there's the two of us!

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:00.360
I'm Kobako!

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:02.550
I'm Benimaru!

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:09.120
Thank you so much for saving them
from a dangerous situation.

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:15.200
Come on! Kobako and Benimaru,
you need to thank this samurai.

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.000
Thank you, Samurai-sama!

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.600
Thank you, Big Guy!

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:21.180
Excuse me, but...

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:24.840
What is your name, sir?
Which clan are you from?

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:28.770
Yojiro Akizuki. Just a ronin.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.890
Just a ronin, huh?

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:34.680
But your skills were like no other.

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:38.320
Not only that, but you seem to
despise the government.

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:42.860
I smell it. Yeah, I can smell it.
The smell of danger...

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:43.920
Oh, hey!

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:45.700
Hey!

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:50.540
Just like I thought...

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:53.330
Was that okay, Master?

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:58.810
Sooner or later we'll run into him again.

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:02.650
As long as we're here in Yokohama.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:14.690
Come one, come all!

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:18.070
Performing here at the Ushioza
for the very first time!

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:21.030
We're the Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe!

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:25.510
Today's performance is a new interpretation
of the unusual runaway horse,

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:26.670
Tsuginosuke Kawai

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:28.740
which traveled all over
the land of rising sun!

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:33.700
The title is "Japanese Kabuki -
The New Tale of Ryoma Sakamoto"!

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:40.090
Thank you very much!

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.190
Zagashira, we're sold out!

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.750
It seems so.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:46.350
Thank you!

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:48.490
I'm coming in.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:56.260
Leader, we're sold out.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:57.540
Where's Ebisu?

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.270
He hasn't come back yet.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:01.030
Anyone here?

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:05.940
Thank you for waiting.
Kawai-sama, please come this way.

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:07.220
Well then.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.380
So you've heard about what's going on
from Nakaiya-sama?

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:10.590
I have.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:12.680
This is Hario-sama.

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:16.590
He'll be your bodyguard.

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:18.080
Thank you.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.020
The pleasure is mine.

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:29.860
Just my imagination?

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:30.930
That's him!

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:33.230
I'm sure of it!

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.130
I'm sure of it!

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:40.710
I can't let you catch me just yet!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:42.610
Farewell!

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:47.420
Kakunojo!

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:48.750
Seijuro!

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:55.160
Oryo! Don't you love the sea?

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:59.060
I do! How beautiful!

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:01.470
I've decided!

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:04.160
I've decided, Oryo!

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:09.140
I will make a "company"!

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:11.140
"Company"?

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:14.680
The sea is connected with the world.

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:19.810
I'll "do business" with the people
in the world out there!

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:45.050
I see. So you're sure that's him.

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.210
Of course I am!

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.780
How could I forget that bastard's face?

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:50.940
You two.

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:55.350
Keishin?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:58.280
I'll take the kids and go fishing or something.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.690
So where is he now?

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:09.000
At a place called "Shanghai Club" or something.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:12.410
Oh yeah, I heard that Jubei Nakaiya
opened another place.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:15.940
They told me he's been missing since the
destruction of his store, the Akagane Goten.

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.240
Who knows?

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:25.190
Supposedly the Underground Auction is held
there and all kinds of people attend it in disguise.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.210
And he's a participant...

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.890
That's expected.

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:34.300
He's in Yokohama. We should
move the play there.

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:37.820
Your reading was dead on, Master.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:41.100
You can see through everything,
can't you, Master?

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:44.400
We're going to do it tonight, everyone!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.620
We can't see anyone's faces like this.

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:01.450
How can we find him?

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:02.760
Should we call it off?

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:05.450
Don't give me that! I swear I'll find him...

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:09.760
By the way, where is the Auction?

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:15.900
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:18.910
The next item is the finest offering of today!

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.640
Two Gatling guns!

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:25.080
Let's start with this price.

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:27.650
530!

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:29.080
540!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:30.310
550!

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:31.910
560!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.990
Whoa there.

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:35.960
Hey!

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:36.720
Huh?

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:39.420
General guests are not allowed here!

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:43.090
Well, well, I'm sorry about that.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:47.900
It looks like that's the entrance.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.900
I have no problem going through it.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:52.670
Not right now. Let's give it some time.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:01.840
10,000! 10,000!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:04.980
Anyone else?

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:09.820
Is this it? Is this it?

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:15.160
That gentleman over there
is the winning bidder of this item!

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:22.300
Thank you all for waiting! This is it!
Tonight's last item is absolutely the best!

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:24.370
I've no need to say anything.

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:30.040
I'm sure some of you came here
tonight just to win this item!

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:34.380
N-Nakaiya? I thought he died 10 years ago!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.880
Wasn't the government after him?

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:40.150
He was accused of being involved in the
assassination of the Director of Palace Upkeep.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:40.150
Note: A high ranking official in the Ministry of Imperial Household

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:44.620
I thought he was burned along with the Akagane
Goten... Who'd have thought he was still alive?!

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:50.860
Let's start with 50,000 ryo!

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:54.020
The minimum bid increment is 5,000 ryo!

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:58.670
No matter how much you bid,
it's not too high a price!

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:03.070
I, Nakaiya, guarantee that!

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:06.670
Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.180
55,000!

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:13.010
60,000!

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:14.910
65,000!

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:15.920
70,000!

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:19.090
75,000!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:21.920
Come on! Anyone else?

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:53.060
Calm down please!

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:55.760
Quiet please!

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:58.730
Be quiet!

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:48.940
Where is he?

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:30.850
What's going on?

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:31.560
Let's go.

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:32.860
Oh, okay.

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:34.120
We're going this way.

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.630
Where is the Head?

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:43.770
Good fishing! Good fishing!

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:45.970
But I'm the one who caught it!

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:48.470
That's a fire alarm!

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:56.980
I don't see him in the back.
Let's go check out by the entrance.

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:00.680
Shit. Where is he?

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:02.150
Let's hurry.

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:05.520
Lord Hario?

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:24.570
Isn't that?

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:26.940
That's him!

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:28.870
There he is!

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:35.450
So it's finally started moving!

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:39.520
It's finally begun!

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:46.290
Sakamoto-sensei! You've got
a visitor from Totsukawa!

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:48.900
Answer them, Tokichi!

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:55.770
It is early spring, in the 4th year of the Keio Era.

00:21:55.910 --> 00:22:00.150
Three months have passed since
the assassination of Ryoma Sakamoto.

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>A FOUL STAR IN THE SKY</i>

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:09.320
The hand is the sword of love

00:22:09.320 --> 00:22:18.360
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:25.090
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:30.310
The dream is still an illusion

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:34.550
Running on the path

00:22:34.550 --> 00:22:42.060
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:47.830
The torn sword of love

00:22:47.830 --> 00:23:00.070
At the end of it thousands of teardrops become one

00:23:00.070 --> 00:23:05.880
And brighten tomorrow

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:11.590
This hand is the sword of love

00:23:11.590 --> 00:23:20.290
It proves the beginning of all

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:48.920
<i>EPISODE 2
THE EARTH-SPLITTING
SWORD LAUGHS</i>

00:23:33.670 --> 00:23:36.240
Come one, come all!

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:41.080
Harsh and cold winds blow through
all over in this corrupt world.

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:43.380
I close my eyes and can
still see the blood and the flames.

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:45.690
The Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:58.570
performs before the man who killed and
burned my parents along with their shop!

00:23:48.920 --> 00:24:02.580
<i>THE EARTH-SPLITTING</i>
<i>SWORD LAUGHS</i>

00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:02.040
Ladies and gentlemen,
do not miss this revenge drama!
